<title>SLOVENIA: BTC down 3.45 percent in correction.</title>
<headline>BTC down 3.45 percent in correction.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian shopping centre operator BTC fell 3.45 percent in Ljubljana on Friday in what traders said was an overdue correction.</p>
<p>At 0853 GMT BTC was 500 tolars down at 14,000 on volume of 70 shares.</p>
<p>&quot;I think BTC was overpriced and it finally fell to where it should be, but on such low volume each purchase can trigger a large move,&quot; one broker said. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
